flowchart LR
    U[User] -->|Browser input| FE[Static HTML CSS JavaScript dashboard]
    FE -->|Same-origin HTTP JSON| API[Flask application and REST API]
    API -->|Persist request and trace| HDB[(Operational SQLite<br/>requests and agent_executions)]
    API --> ORCH[AgentOrchestrator]
    ORCH --> CLASS[Classification component]
    CLASS --> DEMO[DemoClassifier]
    CLASS --> GEM[GeminiClassifier optional]
    GEM -->|Classification request only| GOOGLE[Gemini Developer API]
    ORCH --> VALID[Validation component]
    ORCH --> ROUTE[Deterministic route selector]
    ROUTE --> EXEC[Registered execution component]
    EXEC --> WF[Six response-only demo workflows]
    ORCH --> CHECK[Checker component]
    ORCH --> REVIEW[Review component]
    REVIEW -->|Human approve reject clarify| U
    API -->|Read dashboard history traces| HDB
    CLI[Evaluation CLI] --> ISOLATED[Temporary request history and traces]
    ISOLATED --> METRICS[Evaluation metrics and robustness probes]
    METRICS --> EDB[(Separate evaluation SQLite<br/>evaluation_runs and evaluation_cases)]
    METRICS --> REPORTS[JSON and CSV report files]
    API -->|Evaluation endpoints| EDB
    FE -->|Poll persisted status and reports| API
    MEMORY[Persistent memory and self-reflection<br/>not implemented]
    style MEMORY stroke-dasharray: 5 5
